@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-18 User (Logged-in) Checkout

class "Checkout / Payment UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "PaymentController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "PaymentService" as Service <<service>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "ShoeDetail" as ShoeDetail <<domain>>
class "Coupon" as Coupon <<domain>>
class "OrderEmailService" as OrderEmailService <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : POST /payments or POST /payments/stripe/create-intent
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> ShoeDetail : uses
Service --> Coupon : uses
Service --> OrderEmailService : uses

note right of UI
UC-18 - User (Logged-in) Checkout
Actors: User
Pre: Đã đăng nhập, cart có items
Post: Redirect đến thanh toán
end note
@enduml
